            "For a backyard office where speed is your main priority, pre-cast hemp-lime blocks are the best fit. Since the blocks are already factory-cured, you avoid the longer drying times of cast-in-situ walls and can lay them like bricks, with plastering possible just days after mortar sets. \n\nBased on your 420 square feet of wall area and a 10-inch target thickness, your planning material volume is 9.9 cubic metres. Please note that this is a planning estimate for volume rather than stamped engineering or final packaging quantities, as final SKUs and package counts are not set in this demo.\n\nWould you like to explore how pre-cast blocks are laid and finished, or do you have any questions about the 2024 IRC Appendix BL building code reference for your project?"
